      "writtenOn": "2021-01-25T11:55:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The second parameter is used only for TP_CONDITION.\nOtherwise, Checking user_mode() can be done before calling a hook or can be done in a hook.\n\nex1)\nvoid do_undefinstr(struct pt_regs *regs)\n{\n   ...\n   if (!user_mode(regs))\n      trace_android_rvh_do_undefinstr(...);\n   ...\n}\n\nex2)\nvoid a_hook(...)\n{\n   if (user_mode(regs))\n      return;\n   ...\n}\n\nBut, I think checking it in TP_CONDITION is better than other manners.",
      "parentUuid": "92ee1a49_18de7f48",
      "revId": "145036233d366d60fa4ba639f5e14c58a900f63c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
